\ Recursion-heavy profile workload.
\ Naive fibonacci calls itself exponentially, so the profile sample
\ should be dominated by `fib` itself plus the arithmetic primitives
\ it calls (`+`, `-`, `<`, `dup`, `if`).

fib: stack-recursive ( n -- fib(n) ) [
  dup 2 < [ ] [
    dup 1 - fib swap 2 - fib +
  ] if
] ;

20 fib drop
